source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A brace form closes even before a word rune, so nothing is killed and Jira bolds the single rune; jiro reads the bold effect and keeps the rest as text.
-- input.jira --
*a{*}b*
-- rendered.html --
<p><b>a</b>b*</p>
-- want.md --
**a**b\*
-- warnings.json --
[]
